    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/fhir-harness/process/Process_QuestionnaireWireframeReview",
      "@type": "bootstrap:Process",
      "depiction": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/assets/img/workflows/questionnaire-wireframe-review.svg",
      "description": "A built FHIR Questionnaire shown the way a person will meet it — a mid-fidelity wireframe at web and mobile width, and a live LHC-Forms form view — checked field for field against the L2 wireframe it was derived from, reviewed as a design, staged with deep links, and changed through requests that say which side was edited. Operating skill: fhir-questionnaire-wireframe.\n\nWHERE IT SITS. After SUSHI has compiled the Questionnaire to JSON (l3-fhir-pipeline, Task_Sushi), and wherever a layer above reviews a Questionnaire's fidelity to its wireframe. It reads JSON only, so it can run on any IG that produces a Questionnaire.\n\nWHAT IT DOES NOT CLAIM. A faithful Questionnaire is not therefore a good form, and an accepted form is not therefore conformant: wireframe-design-review judges the first and fhir-validation the second.",
      "enforcement": "advisory",
      "flowCount": 15,
      "inSubgraph": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/fhir-harness/directory/fhir-harness-processes",
